{"parse": {"title": "春日迟-03", "pageid": 134675, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-02\" title=\"春日迟-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">春日迟-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%A5%E6%97%A5%E8%BF%9F-04\" title=\"春日迟-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">春日迟</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.A2.E9.97.AE.E6.B4.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"客问津\">客问津</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 客问津</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Portward Bound</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-3_4_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-3_4_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-3_4_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>初春的晚风清凉，带着玉兰的香味，以及江水沉静的腥气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>入夜后，长街上行人渐少。一名小贩挑着没卖完的两担玉兰花，慢悠悠往街那头走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪趴在窗口向外望，眼睛一眨不眨，直到他消失在远处的阴影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>在想什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>我在想……每次下山，总有好多新东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>就比如那出《受长生》！我还是第一次见水上的戏台。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>隔得那么远，不知道舞剑的究竟是谁，不过，想来很威风吧？所以才一阵一阵地有人叫好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>船上的灯火，连江面都照亮了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>嗯。今年正巧赶上春社，我也是第一次见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>他们能扎那么漂亮的鱼龙灯！竹篾又细又密，就像用针线织在一起的。舞起来也好看，和莲池里的鲤鱼一模一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>二师兄从前也买过，你不记得了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>当然记得，但还是这次的更让人移不开眼嘛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>新奇的吃食也多。豆腐上居然覆着白毛，鱼的味道也古怪……虽说不难吃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>还有方才的玉兰，我们今早在城门也见过有人叫卖的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>玉兰花……对，我也问过你，是否要带些回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314114.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314114.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-314114.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314114.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，我其实是想要一捧的！不过就算买了，等回到山里，花也早就谢了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>还不如叫别人买走，还能多养些时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>茶来了——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_23.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_23\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_23\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_4_bg_23.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_23.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_4_bg_23.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_23.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/49/Cg-3_4_bg_23.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_23.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说话间，伙计将茶水送上来，又附了两碟精细的果子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>吴地来的点心，甜甜蜜蜜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>还有吴地的点心啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>那是，整个涣州只有我家有，别处可吃不到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>看到外面的渡口没有？这点心不经放，一下船就吃还是好的，运到邻县就要变味啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>涣州多山，出入一向不方便，唯独我们淳镇东边有个渡口，好马快帆，才能赶上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>吴地点心最精细，就是太甜，不知道二位能不能吃得惯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>多谢。那我更要试试了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拈起一块绿色点心，细细端详。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>听师父说，我也是吴地人，这有什……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——这也太甜了，还是豆沙做的馅料！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小二：</div><div>小的可提醒过了，菜品一经售出，概不退换啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>师姐摇头笑笑，推过一盏清茶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>快喝一口解解腻吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>今岁新芽尚未长成，茶仍旧是去年的陈茶，却也根根分明，茶汤有股极清淡的香味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那绿豆糕吃起来和师兄们买给我的好不一样，我猜加了糯米和麻油！真不知是怎么调配的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>要是在涣州卖呢，或许该去掉冰糖豆沙的馅料，换上更清淡的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯，不过用什么会好些？椒盐？……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——师姐？你还在听吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风变大了些，檐角下的铃铛叮叮当当地响起来。一对休憩的鸟儿被惊动，扑棱棱地飞走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你是真的想下山卖绿豆糕吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>当然想！不过，我总不能就这么走了呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>就像师兄们，也不是真的那么想待在山上吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>二师兄……我见过他舞自己的剑，好威风！话本里侠客能截断秋水的剑也不过如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>……但我派金丹术专修调气与存元，长生剑并不求这样一往无前的锋芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>对呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>三师兄更是只喜欢诗词歌赋。我刚入门时，他还成天捧着一卷诗钞翻来翻去，连祖师的尊号都记不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>让他读上几十年的道藏，也当真为难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>你们都还留在门中呢，又对我这么好，我当然不能自己离开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>唉，你们一个两个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>多少人想入白马派修习长生之法。在你们口中，这反倒成了一文不值的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>师姐，可是，卖绿豆糕与修长生术，又有什么区别呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>……真是孩子话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声轻叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647502.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647502.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-647502.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">师姐：</div><div>自然有区别。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>积雪堪堪融化了一半，正是最泥泞难行的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街上行人不算多，三两商贩靠在路边，神态惫懒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>要我说，明年咱们也该去祝县的大集！留在淳镇有几个钱好赚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>唉，你让我再想想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>还想什么？睁眼看看，如今镇上人都快走光了！发财要么靠南来北往的行人，要么专捞偏门，咱们哪做得来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>我知道，我知道。只是祖祖辈辈都在淳镇，突然说要走，实在舍不得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>难道我不是吗？俗话说，树挪死人挪活，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>哒哒的蹄声打断了二人的争论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>——劳驾，二位，东门渡怎么走？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>东门渡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>听口音，道长从外地来？若是往祝县看集，东门渡的方向可不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>无妨，小道不去祝县。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>那，我也得冒昧多问上一句，道长一个人去东门渡做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>那地方可荒得很……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>不必担心，我倒也有个同行的朋友。她一时忘了路，我脚程快，先折回镇上打听打听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>哎，你管人家做什么？管好你自己吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/HeadIconSmall-644202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">年轻商贩：</div><div>道长，看到前边的牌坊了没？过了牌坊一直往东，穿过林子走到江边，再顺着水流的方向往下就是了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>多谢多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>道人做了个揖，原本要转身离去，不知想起什么，忽地站住。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>对了，东门渡……是个渡口吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>确实是个渡口，不过早就荒废了，只是名字一直没变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>原来如此！我听着耳熟，似乎从前去过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>……道长莫不是在说笑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>我祖父那一辈，渡口就没什么人了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"644402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"644402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-644402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-644402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">疲惫的商贩：</div><div>您却是何时去过啊？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "春日迟-03"}}